```

Bodyweight warm-up and cool-down moves take `bells: 0`, `defaultWorkSeconds: 30`, and `warmupSuitable` or `cooldownSuitable` set to `true`.

**The flags are exclusive.** `filterPool` in Task 6 drops anything flagged
`warmupSuitable` or `cooldownSuitable` from the main pool, so a move is either
main work or ancillary, never both. A halo used as a warm-up is not also offered
as main work.

`src/lib/data/combos.ts`:

