## Not in this plan

Phase 2, turning an Instagram Reel into database entries, is specified in
`docs/SPEC.md` section 11 and gets its own plan once v1 is in use. It needs no
change to anything built here: it appends records to `src/lib/data/exercises.ts`
and `src/lib/data/combos.ts` and drops stills into `public/exercises/`.

The fourteen batch 2 stills and the twelve batch 3 stills are Thomas's to supply.
The app works without them, and `npm run media:todo` says what is outstanding.
